meta {
  name: Run Gemini
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{aiUwLambdaUrl}}/workflows/collateral-review-v2-gemini/run
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "loan_id": {{loan_id}},
    "workflow_id": "{{workflow_id}}",
    "workflow_run_id": "{{workflow_run_id_phase_5}}",
    "phase": "PHASE_5_v2"
  }
}

vars:pre-request {
  aiUwLambdaUrl: https://xsug4clelwjxmace3mckpnmdae0flkdi.lambda-url.us-east-1.on.aws/
  pdf_url: https://rbialliance.retool.com/api/file/435f3e03-2f80-402e-be58-57771c316efc
}

docs {
  Run the v2 collateral-review pipeline against the Gemini backend.
  
  Routing:
    Bruno → API Gateway → ai-uw-dispatcher → ai-uw-collateral-review-v2-gemini
  
  The dispatcher matches `collateral-review-v2-gemini` in WORKFLOW_ROUTING and
  invokes the Lambda whose `AI_BACKEND` env var is set to `gemini`.

  Trigger payload (v1-style stateful trigger — NOT `pdf_url` anymore):
    {
      "loan_id": 615,
      "workflow_id": "<workflow_loan_summary UUID>",
      "workflow_run_id": "<WorkflowRun UUID>",   // optional
      "phase": "PHASE_5_v2"
    }
  The lambda enriches this via load_loan_context, resolves the appraisal
  report URL from the POS document store itself, creates a
  CollateralReviewV2Validation row, runs PDF → AI → enrichment → scoring,
  PATCHes the row, and posts the phase + workflow callbacks.

  Required SSM secret: `/ai-uw/gemini-api-key` (set via the AWS console or
  `aws ssm put-parameter --name /ai-uw/gemini-api-key --value <key> --type SecureString --overwrite`).
  
  Cold-start ~10s, hot ~2s. The v2 lambdas have Timeout: 300s so a large PDF
  with deep AI analysis may take a few minutes.
  
  Response shape (success):
    {
      "success": true,
      "validation_id": 123,
      "data": {
        "overall_score": 0-100,
        "overall_status": "pass" | "review" | "fail",
        "risk_score": 0-100,
        "module_scores": { ... per-module + risk_flags ... },
        "property_data": { ... },
        "comp_data": { ... },
        "market_data": { ... },
        "extraction_snapshot": { ... }
      }
    }
}
